"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11638","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21378","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"31845","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"67011","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"307112","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"11262","synopsis":"Himekawa needs more power to fight against the tri-headed dragon that caused her so much trauma in her past. But the pleasure of the Climax Hybrid goes against the strict and disciplined life that she's forced on herself after she failed to protect the people boarding the Tokyo megafloat. It's up to Kizuna to break down the walls she's built up for herself, and teach her to enjoy the ecstasy she needs to defeat the enemy.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eJYD5oP8chewmXPUMx1SnWWbBZ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Himekawa needs more power to fight against the tri-headed dragon that caused her so much trauma in her past. But the pleasure of the Climax Hybrid goes against the strict and disciplined life that she's forced on herself after she failed to protect the people boarding the Tokyo megafloat. It's up to Kizuna to break down the walls she's built up for herself, and teach her to enjoy the ecstasy she needs to defeat the enemy.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eJYD5oP8chewmXPUMx1SnWWbBZ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11638","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21378","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"31845","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"67011","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"307112","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"11263","synopsis":"Ataraxia is united with the Masters, the aces of the Western USA megafloat. Despite Yurishia being their former leader, they're very cold to her. Their leader, Scarlet, fights with Yurishia over Kizuna, but their battle is interrupted when another leader from the Batlantis Empire attacks!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bhmtCuUNlCgdO93vQLyzlm8aebo.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Ataraxia is united with the Masters, the aces of the Western USA megafloat. Despite Yurishia being their former leader, they're very cold to her. Their leader, Scarlet, fights with Yurishia over Kizuna, but their battle is interrupted when another leader from the Batlantis Empire attacks!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bhmtCuUNlCgdO93vQLyzlm8aebo.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11638","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21378","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"31845","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"67011","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"307112","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"11264","synopsis":"After their defeat by Grabel, Amaterasu needs a new weapon to protect Ataraxia: the Connective Hybrid. To use it, Kizuna will have to perform the climax hybrid with two girls at once! He picks Yurishia and Scarlet, hoping to defuse the tension between them. Will the pleasure be enough to cause them to reunite? And can they retake Guam, and eventually Japan, from the Batlantis empire?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hi0AdeqIh3lNUNQ7qe72arBAUXB.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"After their defeat by Grabel, Amaterasu needs a new weapon to protect Ataraxia: the C